{"id":377,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"Cutting-edge technology was used to study the internals of this Pokémon’s rock body, but nothing was found—not even a brain or a heart."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Every bit of Regirock’s body is made of stone. As parts of its body erode, this Pokémon sticks rocks to itself to repair what’s been lost."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Regirock’s body is composed entirely of rocks. Recently, a study made the startling discovery that the rocks were all unearthed from different locations."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Regirock was sealed away by people long ago. If this Pokémon’s body is damaged in battle, it is said to seek out suitable rocks on its own to repair itself."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"The same rocks that form its body have been found in ground layers around the world."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its entire body is made of rock. If any part chips off in battle, it attaches rocks to repair itself."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It is entirely composed of rocks with no sign of a brain or heart. It is a mystery even to modern scientists."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"A POKéMON that is made entirely of rocks and boulders. If parts of its body chip off in battle, REGIROCK repairs itself by adding new rocks."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Clear Body","hidden":false,"description":"Prevents other Pokémon's moves or Abilities from lowering the Pokémon's stats."},{"name":"Sturdy","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon cannot be knocked out by a single hit as long as its HP is full. One-hit KO moves will also fail to knock it out."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":80,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"cave","color":"Brown","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":377,"name":"Regirock","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1